WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.050
A few quick rules.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:12.825
A current directly with you adds its drift to your speed, and one directly against you subtracts it, so ten knots against a two knot current makes eight over the ground.

3
00:00:13.075 --> 00:00:18.575
A cross current needs a course correction into the current, found with the vector diagram.

4
00:00:18.825 --> 00:00:23.500
Wind pushing the boat sideways, called leeway, acts just like a current.

5
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:30.250
And current predictions are only estimates, so keep taking fixes and adjusting your course to steer.
